In the whole area of the islands, payments in British pounds are generally accepted, credit cards can be used in Stanley, and, moreover, you can often pay in U.S. dollars.
There is no count on payment by card, staying on the furthest islands, although British and American currencies can be accepted; it is best to ask the owners in advance about the form of payment.
