Winter sports such as downhill skiing or snowboarding are popular sports, which consist in descending through snowy terrain on skis or snowboards attached to their feet.
Skiing is the main activity on trips for many enthusiasts, sometimes referred to as “skiing lunatics”, who plan an entire skiing holiday in a given place.
Skiing has a very long history – already 5000 years B.C
